[00:18.18]1. Rejoice, give glory to Jehovah,
[00:24.22]For the heavens proclaim all his righteousness.
[00:29.38]Let us sing to our God joyful songs to his praise;
[00:34.22]Let us speak to all of his great acts.
[00:39.42](Chorus)
[00:39.78]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[00:45.08]For Jehovah has become our King!
[00:50.24]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[00:55.38]For Jehovah has become our King!
[01:00.98]2. His glory tell among the nations;
[01:31.54]For Jehovah to us is a God who saves.
[01:37.24]Yes, Jehovah is King; he deserves all the praise.
[01:42.12]So we bow before his mighty throne.
[01:47.30](Chorus)
[01:47.48]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[01:52.86]For Jehovah has become our King!
[01:57.72]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[02:03.24]For Jehovah has become our King!
[02:21.74]3. His righteous rule is now established.
[02:26.74]On his throne, he has placed his anointed Son.
[02:31.62]Let the gods of this world
[02:34.24]be brought down and be shamed,
[02:36.84]For the praise belongs to God alone.
[02:42.04](Chorus)
[02:42.30]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[02:47.44]For Jehovah has become our King!
[02:52.80]Let the heavens rejoice, Let the earth joyful be,
[02:58.02]For Jehovah has become our King!
